{
  "bookId": "rewind-24",
  "id": "chapter-94",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23401001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "聊聊「伊迪丝」吧，FULI即将推出的「新商品」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "还未出荷时，我记得你提起过一次她。你爱上她了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "的确是一张无法忘记的脸。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "哼，不觉得这双眼睛太过「聪明」了么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "你说的不错。\n一个「看起来聪明」的人，总难免踏上更坎坷的旅途。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "你该去听听那些「伊迪丝」的谣言，传疯了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "不，比起这个，我更想要看到——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "一个城市的掌权者、或者在原著中被称为「谈判女王」的她。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "当失去了地位与权利，化身为手办后，会做出怎样的反击。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "七点半的肥皂剧？祝你开心，我没兴趣。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "这么长时间的等待，终于……要在这个世界和你见面了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "伊迪丝，我生命之光，我希冀之火，我的罪恶，我的灵魂。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "当你从盲盒苏醒，看到这份大礼，会做出什么表情？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "真是期待啊~\n很快我们的关系，就要回到过去的那般了吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23401015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "互相厮杀……互相纠缠，直到……永远。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-522",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "edith",
          "rowIds": [
            23401001,
            23401002,
            23401003,
            23401004,
