      "title": "流言·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23404001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒙娜·丽莎",
          "text": "「目标距离」：3.4km。「行动代号」：出荷日-伊迪丝清除计划。\n「波普艺术」小队全员注意，现在开始清点人数。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛丽莲·梦露",
          "text": "队长，我想申请换个代号。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒙娜·丽莎",
          "text": "如果可以更换，我也不会顶着「蒙娜丽莎」这个名字。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒙娜·丽莎",
          "text": "那个该死的墨镜男，谁知道他有这么诡异的爱好，尽快结束这一切，我们都能获得自由。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒙娜·丽莎",
          "text": "到时候你想改名叫特没谱都没人介意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒙娜·丽莎",
          "text": "还有——最后的提醒！\n这次的任务目…很不简单，所有人……做好拼上性命的觉悟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛丽莲·梦露",
          "text": "我知道了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒙娜·丽莎",
          "text": "嗯？？你是什么人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "我是阿尔弗雷德大人派来的，你们要对付的对手很难缠，阿尔弗雷德大人让我给你们准备了一些特殊的装备。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒙娜·丽莎",
          "text": "哼……那家伙，究竟是好心，还是不放心我们呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛丽莲·梦露",
          "text": "发现了，目标！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "蒙娜·丽莎",
          "text": "所有人！！听令，不要给目标任何机会，一起上！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛丽莲·梦露",
          "text": "哈~！看我右拳打开了天化身成龙！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404014",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "嗤——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404015",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玛丽莲·梦露",
          "text": "啊啊啊啊我的手！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管家",
          "text": "好吵，一群疯子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管家",
          "text": "伊迪丝大人，在您苏醒之前，我会一直陪在这里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒙娜·丽莎",
          "text": "你是什么人？可恶，情报中可没有显示还有这种麻烦的家伙！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "罗威……是你到了啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404020",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "伊迪丝 · 代理人\n商品名称：代理人·伊迪丝Ver.  \n作品名称：《永恒的异界幻想》\n制造商：TENMA 天马\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型·附专用底座・全高约242mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管家",
          "text": "是，大人，我已经在这个世界等待你许久。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "这副阵仗，还真是有趣，没想到我才醒来，就有人送了这样的惊喜过来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "嗯？他们身上还有些有趣的小东西，让我想到了一个有些怀念的小可爱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "罗威，你知道该怎么做。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23404025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管家",
          "text": "是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23405001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒙娜·丽莎",
          "text": "你……你怎么会这么强。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23405002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管家",
          "text": "你也是，比我预想的更棘手。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23405003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管家",
          "text": "看来只能说抱歉了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23405004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒙娜·丽莎",
          "text": "抱歉……什么意思？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23405005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管家",
          "text": "你们还能动的，最好现在离远点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23405006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛丽莲·梦露",
          "text": "到底是怎么回事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23405007",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "蒙娜·丽莎",
          "text": "计时器……哪里的计时器声音？！……这是，我的身上！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23405008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛丽莲·梦露",
          "text": "……爆炸了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23405009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玛丽莲·梦露",
          "text": "队长他……爆炸了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-525",
      "sourceRefs": [
